</book><md:intended-use xmlns:md="http://www.klartext-dossier.org/medical-device-file" id="gds-intended-use">
    <md:intended-use-summary>
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The <r>device</r> is a <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#dialysis_machine">dialysis machine</a> providing <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#haemodialysis">haemodialysis</a> treatments for patients with <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#permanent_kidney_failure">permanent kidney failure</a>.</p>
    </md:intended-use-summary>
    <md:medical-purpose>
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The <r>device</r> provides a renal replacement therapy with the following <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#clinical_functions">clinical functions</a>:</p>
        <md:clinical-function name="Ultrafiltration">
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Removal of substances with low <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#molecular_weight">molecular weight</a> from the patient's blood</p>
        </md:clinical-function>
        <md:clinical-function name="Net Fluid Removal">
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Removal of excess water from the patient's blood</p>
        </md:clinical-function>
        <ops:ops-code xmlns:ops="http://www.klartext-dossier.org/ops-2025" ref="ce07f3354c0c031d666337ce95e8b929__code-8-854.x">
        </ops:ops-code>
    </md:medical-purpose>
    <md:medical-indication>
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><r>patient</r>s with <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#permanent_kidney_failure">permanent kidney failure</a> and low <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#glomerular_filtration_rate">glomerular filtration rate</a> (<a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#gfr">GFR</a> &lt; 15 mL/min).</p>
        <icd:icd-code xmlns:icd="http://www.klartext-dossier.org/icd-10-gm" ref="28c38fae6024c6bfd21ce5a98b6b1c99__code-N18.5">
        </icd:icd-code>
        <icd:icd-code xmlns:icd="http://www.klartext-dossier.org/icd-10-gm" ref="28c38fae6024c6bfd21ce5a98b6b1c99__code-Z99.2">
        </icd:icd-code>
    </md:medical-indication>
    <md:patient-group name="Patient" id="patient">
<p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Patients with <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#permanent_kidney_failure">permanent kidney failure</a> and a <a data-type="xref" data-xrefstyle="glossary" href="#body-weight">body-weight</a> &gt; 40 kg.</p>
    </md:patient-group>
